   "text": "Westminster International University in Tashkent - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nWestminster International University in Tashkent\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\n(WIUT) is the first international university in Uzbekistan and first in Central Asia to offer Western education, with United Kingdom (UK) qualifications. WIUT was established in 2002 in partnership between the \"UMID\" Presidential Foundation, the Ministry of Higher and Secondary Specialized Education of Uzbekistan, and the University of Westminster in London (UoW).\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n30/04/2026 07:55\nby Gunia Beniwal\nCreated\n01/04/2026 08:08\nby Eston Dalmeida\nType\nUniversity\nCountry\nUzbekistan\nYearly Fees\nMax: US$6,400.00\nMin: US$4,600.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n2%\n100 of 5,000 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPublic\nProvider\nDirect QS\nFounded Year\n2002\nCampus(es)\nTashkent\nCountry\nUzbekistan\nExcluded Countries\nNA\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n01/04/2026\nContract End Date\n31/12/2026\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\n-\nScholarship Offered\n-\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uGPvgqolMF8\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
